    "title": "What Is Islamic Studies? by Professors Leif Stenberg and Philip Wood",
    "subtitle": "AKU-ISMC Publications",
    "summary": "AKU-ISMC's Leif Stenberg and Philip Wood discuss their new book.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "3b7b5cc9b09e5e94",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "2902-BannerImage.jpg",
